sequenceDiagram
  actor Customer as Khách hàng
  participant UI as CustomerOrderScreen
  participant Repo as ApiCustomerOrderRepository
  participant Menu as GuestMenuController
  participant Session as SessionsController
  participant Guard as JwtAuthGuard + PermissionsGuard
  participant SS as SessionsService
  participant Order as OrdersController
  participant OS as OrdersService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL / Prisma
  Customer->>UI: Mở màn hình đặt món
  UI->>Repo: getCustomerMenu()
  Repo->>Menu: GET /api/v1/menu-items/customer/menu (public read-only)
  Menu->>DB: findCustomerMenu()
  DB-->>Menu: Categories + available items
  Menu-->>Repo: HTTP 200
  Customer->>UI: Chọn món và gửi
  UI->>Repo: startSession()
  Repo->>Session: POST /api/v1/sessions/customer/open [Bearer]
  Session->>Guard: JWT + customer:session:start
  Guard-->>Session: Cho phép
  Session->>SS: openForCustomer(userId)
  SS->>DB: Tìm TableDevice theo userId
  alt Có phiên OPEN
    SS->>DB: Lấy phiên và Order hiện tại
  else Bàn AVAILABLE
    SS->>DB: Transaction tạo DiningSession + Order; cập nhật OCCUPIED
  end
  DB-->>SS: Session snapshot
  SS-->>Repo: Session id
  Repo->>Order: POST /api/v1/customer/session/items [Bearer]
  Order->>Guard: JWT + customer:order:create-item
  Guard-->>Order: Cho phép
  Order->>OS: addCustomerItems(userId, items)
  OS->>DB: Kiểm tra bàn/phiên/món/giá
  OS->>DB: Transaction tạo OrderItem + history + audit
  DB-->>OS: Created items (Prisma itemNameSnapshot)
  OS-->>Order: Response maps itemNameSnapshot to JSON itemName
  Order-->>Repo: HTTP 201
  Repo-->>UI: Order result
  loop Polling 5 giây
    UI->>Repo: loadCustomerData(true) + getActiveSession()
    Repo->>Menu: GET /api/v1/menu-items/customer/menu (public)
    Repo->>Order: GET /api/v1/customer/session [Bearer]
    Order->>Guard: JWT + customer:session:read
    Guard-->>Order: Cho phép
    Order->>OS: getCustomerSession(userId)
    OS->>DB: Đọc phiên, Order và OrderItems
    DB-->>OS: Customer session snapshot
    OS-->>Order: Current customer session
    Order-->>Repo: HTTP 200
    Repo->>Session: GET /api/v1/sessions/customer/active [Bearer]
    Session->>Guard: JWT + customer:session:start
    Guard-->>Session: Cho phép
    Session->>SS: getActiveForCustomer(userId)
    SS->>DB: Đọc phiên OPEN theo TableDevice
    DB-->>SS: Active session snapshot
    SS-->>Session: Active session
    Session-->>Repo: HTTP 200
    Repo-->>UI: Menu + current order + active session snapshot
  end
  UI-->>Customer: Hiển thị món và trạng thái mới
